<div class="bo-sheet">
    <div class="bo-letterhead">{{ repeated_header | safe }}</div>

    <div class="appointment-letter">

    <table class="top-info-table">
        <tr>
            <td class="top-left">
                {% if salutation %}{{ salutation }} {% endif %}{{ employee_name }}<br>
                {% if employee_address %}
                    {{ employee_address }}
                {% endif %}
            </td>

            <td class="top-right">
                Date: {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(appointment_date, "dd MMMM yyyy") }}
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="title">APPOINTMENT LETTER</div>

    <div class="para">
        Dear {% if salutation %}{{ salutation }} {% endif %}{{ employee_name }},
    </div>

    <div class="para">
        This is with reference to your employment application and your subsequent interviews with us.
        We are pleased to appoint you as
        <span class="bold">{{ designation }}</span>
        in
        <span class="bold">{{ department_clean }}</span>
        with effect from
        <span class="bold">{{ frappe.utils.formatdate(joining_date, "dd MMMM yyyy") }}</span>.
    </div>

    <div class="para">
        A non-exhaustive list of the Terms and Conditions of your employment is provided as under:
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">
        A. &nbsp;&nbsp; <span class="bold">REMUNERATION:</span>
        <span style="margin-left: 22px;">
            (Your monthly gross salary break-up) :
        </span>
    </div>

    <table class="salary-table">
        <tr>
            <td>Basic Salary:</td>
            <td>Rs. {{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(salary.basic or 0, currency=None) }} per Month</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Medical Allowance:</td>
            <td>
                Rs. {{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(salary.medical or 0, currency=None) }} per Month
                (After successful completion of probation period)
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="para">
        In addition to the above, you shall be provided with other benefits proportionate to your grade
        as per organization policies.
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">
        B. &nbsp;&nbsp; <span class="bold">TERMS AND CONDITIONS:</span>
    </div>

    <ol class="terms">
        <li>
            The above break-up of Gross Salary may be modified according to organization’s policie's
            however the gross salary as shown above will remain unchanged. Income tax and other
            applicable taxes will be borne by you as applicable.
        </li>

        <li>
            You will be on probation for a period of <span class="bold">Six (6) months</span> from the date of appointment,
            which may be extended at the sole discretion of the management. During the probationary
            period your services can be terminated without assigning any reason or notice thereof.
        </li>

        <li>
            During the probationary period of <span class="bold">Six (6) months</span>, either the Organization or the Employee
            may terminate the employment by giving three (3) working days' prior written notice.
        </li>

        <li>
            Upon confirmation of employment, if the Organization decides to discontinue the Employee's
            services, or if the Employee wishes to resign from employment, either party shall provide
            the other party with a minimum of twenty-five (25) working days prior written notice.
        </li>

        <li>
            The notice period may, however, be reduced or extended by mutual understanding between
            the Organization and the Employee if required.
        </li>

        <li>
            The retirement age in our organization is set at sixty-five (65) years. Such retirement age
            may be revised by the management, in their sole discretion, at any time.
        </li>

        <li>
            You will not disclose your salary and future compensations either directly or indirectly
            to any person within the organization.
        </li>

        <li>
            Your entitlement to avail leave will be in accordance with the organization policies,
            as framed and amended, from time to time.
        </li>
    </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="bo-footer">{{ repeated_footer | safe }}</div>
</div>

<div class="bo-sheet bo-sheet-last">
    <div class="bo-letterhead">{{ repeated_header | safe }}</div>

    <div class="appointment-letter">
        <ol class="terms" start="9">

            <li>
                You may be transferred to any other department at the sole discretion of the management.
            </li>

            <li>
                You will be obligated to make good, any loss or damage to the organization property caused
                by your negligence, inadvertence, fraud, carelessness or act or omission. Moreover, the
                termination of your service may not exonerate you from liability to make good this loss
                or damage.
            </li>

            <li>
                In case of breach of any of the terms of this appointment and any rules and regulations
                of service, or for any other misconduct, you will be subject to appropriate disciplinary
                action, as deemed fit by the management and which may lead to termination of your services.
            </li>

            <li>
                You will discharge all such duties, responsibilities and authorities as assigned to you,
                efficiently and diligently to the satisfaction of the management and you will not act in
                any manner contrary to the interest of the organization.
            </li>

            <li>
                You will promote the interest of the organization to the best of your abilities, skills
                and knowledge.
            </li>

            <li>
                During your employment or after its termination you will not disclose any information
                relating to the organization that you may obtain while you are in the service.
            </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="close-text">
            Kindly return the duplicate copy of this letter duly signed by you signifying your acceptance
            to the enclosed terms and conditions of this Appointment Letter.
        </div>

        <div class="signature-block">
            Yours Sincerely,<br>
            For <span class="bold">Trust Jamiat Talim-UL-Quran</span>
        </div>

        <div class="manager">
            Manager HR
        </div>

        <div class="acceptance">
            I have read understood & hereby accept the above terms & conditions of appointment and agree
            to abide by the same.
        </div>

        <div class="employee-sign">
            <div class="employee-sign-row">
                <span class="employee-sign-label">Signature</span>
                <span class="employee-sign-colon">:</span>
                <span class="employee-sign-line"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="employee-sign-row">
                <span class="employee-sign-label">Name</span>
                <span class="employee-sign-colon">:</span>
                <span class="employee-sign-line"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="employee-sign-row">
                <span class="employee-sign-label">Dated</span>
                <span class="employee-sign-colon">:</span>
                <span class="employee-sign-line"></span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bo-footer">{{ repeated_footer | safe }}</div>
</div>
"}]

html:
{% set emp = frappe.get_doc("Employee", doc.employee) if doc.employee else None %}
{% set currency = doc.currency or frappe.db.get_value("Company", doc.company, "default_currency") or "PKR" %}

{% set department_raw = emp.department if emp else "-" %}
{% set department = department_raw.rsplit(" - ", 1)[0] if department_raw and department_raw != "-" and " - " in department_raw else department_raw %}
{% set designation = emp.designation if emp else "-" %}
{% set madrasa = (emp.get("custom_madrasa") or emp.get("madrasa") or "-") if emp else "-" %}
{% set branch_id = emp.branch if emp else "" %}
{% set branch_name = frappe.db.get_value("Branch", branch_id, "branch") or frappe.db.get_value("Branch", branch_id, "branch_name") or branch_id or "-" %}
{% set urdu_name = emp.get("custom_مکمل_نام") if emp else (doc.get("custom_مکمل_نام") or "") %}
{% set deduction_state = namespace(count=0) %}
{% for row in doc.get("deductions") or [] %}
    {% if row.salary_component %}
        {% set deduction_state.count = deduction_state.count + 1 %}
    {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% set has_deductions = deduction_state.count > 0 %}

<style>
.print-heading {
    display: none !important;
}

.print-format {
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
}

.letter-head {
    margin: 0 auto 3mm auto !important;
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
}

.letter-head img {
    display: block;
    height: auto !important;
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 100% !important;
}

.ss-page {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    color: #000;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 185mm;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4mm 5mm 0 5mm;
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1;
}

.ss-title {
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
}

.ss-top-line {
    border-top: 2px solid #000;
    margin-bottom: 4mm;
}

.ss-info-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
    margin-bottom: 2mm;
}

.ss-info-table td {
    padding: 1px 4px;
    line-height: 0.4;
    vertical-align: top;
}

.ss-label {
    font-weight: bold;
    width: 12%;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.ss-value {
    width: 34%;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.ss-label-right {
    font-weight: bold;
    width: 14%;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.ss-value-right {
    width: 32%;
    text-align: right;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.ss-urdu-inline {
    direction: rtl;
    unicode-bidi: isolate;
    font-family: "Noto Nastaliq Urdu", "Jameel Noori Nastaleeq", "Arial", sans-serif;
    margin-left: 6px;
}

.ss-grid-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
    margin-bottom: 2mm;
}

.ss-grid-wrap > tbody > tr > td {
    width: 50%;
    vertical-align: top;
    padding: 0;
}

.ss-grid-wrap .left-box {
    padding-right: 17mm;
}

.ss-grid-wrap .right-box {
    padding-left: 17mm;
}

.ss-grid-wrap.no-deductions {
    width: 50%;
}

.ss-grid-wrap.no-deductions > tbody > tr > td {
    width: 100%;
}

.ss-grid-wrap.no-deductions .left-box {
    padding-right: 0;
}

.ss-component-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
    font-size: 9px;
}

.ss-component-table th,
.ss-component-table td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 1px 4px;
    line-height: 0.4;
}

.ss-component-table th {
    background: #eeeeee;
    color: #000;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: left;
}

.ss-sr {
    width: 9%;
    text-align: center;
}

.ss-component {
    width: 60%;
}

.ss-amount {
    width: 25%;
    text-align: right;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.ss-summary {
    width: 48%;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-bottom: 4mm;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.05;
}

.ss-summary td {
    padding: 1px 0;
    line-height: 1;
}

.ss-summary-label {
    width: 45%;
    text-align: left;
}

.ss-summary-amount {
    width: 55%;
    text-align: right;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.ss-rounded {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 13px;
}

.ss-words-label {
    vertical-align: top;
}

.ss-words {
    text-align: right;
    line-height: 1.1;
}

.ss-leave-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
    font-size: 9px;
    margin-top: 0;
}

.ss-leave-table th,
.ss-leave-table td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 2px 5px;
    line-height: 0.5;
}

.ss-leave-table th {
    background: #eeeeee;
    color: #000;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: left;
}

.text-right {
    text-align: right;
}

.text-center {
    text-align: center;
}
</style>

{% set hide_letter_head = no_letterhead in [1, "1", true, "true", "True"] %}
{% if letter_head and not hide_letter_head %}
<div class="letter-head">{{ letter_head }}</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="ss-page">

    <div class="ss-title">
        Sal Slip/{{ doc.employee or "-" }}/{{ doc.name or "-" }}
    </div>

    <div class="ss-top-line"></div>

    <table class="ss-info-table">
        <tr>
            <td class="ss-label">Company</td>
            <td class="ss-value">{{ doc.company or "-" }}</td>

            <td class="ss-label-right">Start Date</td>
            <td class="ss-value-right">{{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.start_date, "dd-MM-yyyy") if doc.start_date else "-" }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="ss-label">Employee ID</td>
            <td class="ss-value">{{ doc.employee or "-" }}</td>

            <td class="ss-label-right">End Date</td>
            <td class="ss-value-right">{{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.end_date, "dd-MM-yyyy") if doc.end_date else "-" }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="ss-label">Name</td>
            <td class="ss-value">{{ doc.employee_name or "-" }}{% if urdu_name %} <span class="ss-urdu-inline">{{ urdu_name }}</span>{% endif %}</td>

            <td class="ss-label-right">Working Days</td>
            <td class="ss-value-right">{{ doc.total_working_days or 0 }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="ss-label">Department</td>
            <td class="ss-value">{{ department or "-" }}</td>

            <td class="ss-label-right">Absent</td>
            <td class="ss-value-right">{{ doc.absent_days or 0 }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="ss-label">Designation</td>
            <td class="ss-value">{{ designation or "-" }}</td>

            <td class="ss-label-right">Leaves</td>
            <td class="ss-value-right">{{ doc.leave_days or 0 }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="ss-label">Madrasa</td>
            <td class="ss-value">{{ madrasa or "-" }}</td>

            <td class="ss-label-right">Leaves Without Pay</td>
            <td class="ss-value-right">{{ doc.leave_without_pay or 0 }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="ss-label">Branch</td>
            <td class="ss-value">{{ branch_name or "-" }}</td>

            <td class="ss-label-right">Deduction Hours</td>
            <td class="ss-value-right">{{ doc.get("custom_deduction_hour") or 0 }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="ss-label">Month</td>
            <td class="ss-value">{{ frappe.utils.formatdate(doc.start_date, "MMMM yyyy") if doc.start_date else "-" }}</td>

            <td class="ss-label-right">Payment Days</td>
            <td class="ss-value-right">{{ doc.payment_days or 0 }}</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td class="ss-label"></td>
            <td class="ss-value"></td>

            <td class="ss-label-right">Mode Of Payment</td>
            <td class="ss-value-right">{{ doc.mode_of_payment or emp.get("salary_mode") or "-" if emp else doc.mode_of_payment or "-" }}</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table class="ss-grid-wrap{% if not has_deductions %} no-deductions{% endif %}">
        <tr>
            <td class="left-box">
                <table class="ss-component-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th class="ss-sr">Sr</th>
                            <th class="ss-component">Component</th>
                            <th class="ss-amount">Amount</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        {% for row in doc.earnings %}
                        <tr>
                            <td class="ss-sr">{{ loop.index }}</td>
                            <td>{{ row.salary_component or "-" }}</td>
                            <td class="ss-amount">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(row.amount or 0, currency=currency) }}</td>
                        </tr>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </td>

            {% if has_deductions %}
            <td class="right-box">
                <table class="ss-component-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th class="ss-sr">Sr</th>
                            <th class="ss-component">Component</th>
                            <th class="ss-amount">Amount</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        {% set deduction_row = namespace(index=0) %}
                        {% for row in doc.deductions %}
                        {% if row.salary_component %}
                        {% set deduction_row.index = deduction_row.index + 1 %}
                        <tr>
                            <td class="ss-sr">{{ deduction_row.index }}</td>
                            <td>{{ row.salary_component or "-" }}</td>
                            <td class="ss-amount">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(row.amount or 0, currency=currency) }}</td>
                        </tr>
                        {% endif %}
                        {% endfor %}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </td>
            {% endif %}
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table class="ss-summary">
        <tr>
            <td class="ss-summary-label">Gross Pay:</td>
            <td class="ss-summary-amount">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(doc.gross_pay or 0, currency=currency) }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="ss-summary-label">Total Deduction:</td>
            <td class="ss-summary-amount">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(doc.total_deduction or 0, currency=currency) }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="ss-summary-label">Net Pay:</td>
            <td class="ss-summary-amount">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(doc.net_pay or 0, currency=currency) }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="ss-summary-label">Rounded Total:</td>
            <td class="ss-summary-amount ss-rounded">{{ frappe.utils.fmt_money(doc.rounded_total or doc.net_pay or 0, currency=currency) }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="ss-summary-label ss-words-label">Total in Words:</td>
            <td class="ss-words">{{ frappe.utils.money_in_words(doc.rounded_total or doc.net_pay or 0, currency) }}</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <table class="ss-leave-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="width: 5%;">Sr</th>
                <th>Leave Type</th>
                <th class="text-right" style="width: 22%;">Total Allocated Leaves</th>
                <th class="text-right" style="width: 16%;">Used Leaves</th>
                <th class="text-right" style="width: 18%;">Available Leaves</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {% if doc.get("leave_details") %}
                {% for row in doc.get("leave_details") %}
                <tr>
                    <td class="text-center">{{ loop.index }}</td>
                    <td>{{ row.leave_type or "-" }}</td>
                    <td class="text-right">{{ row.total_allocated_leaves or row.get("total_leaves_allocated") or 0 }}</td>
                    <td class="text-right">{{ row.used_leaves or 0 }}</td>
                    <td class="text-right">{{ row.available_leaves or 0 }}</td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            {% else %}
                <tr>
                    <td colspan="5" class="text-center">No Leave Allocation Found</td>
                </tr>
            {% endif %}
        </tbody>
    </table>

</div>
